  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: TutorialScene3
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: "Alright, so Exor\u2019s are powered by the pilot\u2019s body. I don\u2019t
      know if you listened to your history lessons, but back when the 10,000 humans
      traveleled to planet namek, they discovered a hidden energy within their muscles
      that resonates with the core of planet namek. This energy is called <muscle
      energy>"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 29aacfb9bef8d44c995b9667a7eae78f, type: 2}
  - text: At first it was nothing more than, an energy that allowed us to comfortably
      live in planet namek, but our great ancestor exalted junjun discovered a way
      to power the mechs with this heart energy. It increased the power of the first
      generation of mechs by 10 folds.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 29aacfb9bef8d44c995b9667a7eae78f, type: 2}
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 7cb838e9d60884c87a8aa7d95c78bf9e, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
